Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The methodology was distilled from 899 publicly published WeChat Official
Account articles (2015-09-15 .. 2018-12-27) and cross-checked against
public frameworks (4A / STP / Aaker / JTBD / pyramid principle / IAB Brand
Safety GARM 12). The README distribution format references
dontbesilent2025/dbskill (CC BY-NC 4.0) — that is an acknowledgement of
influence and of a documented prior art, not a claim of derivation from
its code. No verbatim corpus is stored in this repo outside `references/`.